# Copy this file to .env and fill in your key: cp .env.example .env
# .env is gitignored — never commit real keys.
#
# ⚠️ This is a client-only Vite app with no backend. VITE_-prefixed vars are
# baked into the public JS bundle at build time — anyone who opens the
# deployed site's dev tools (or just downloads the JS file) can read this key
# in plaintext. Fine for local development; do NOT set this in a production
# deploy (Vercel env vars, etc.) unless you're comfortable with every visitor
# sharing — and billing against — this one key. For a real production
# secret, put the Anthropic call behind a server/serverless function instead.
VITE_CLAUDE_API_KEY=
